    "turn_text": "you know, I understand, you know, if maybe it wasn't your call, but you'll be there now that you are, right? This has been a relatively difficult time to get mergers and acquisitions through. We've seen a few blocked relatively recently. This would be another term that was used was a cherished organization, you know, the PGA tour, and it's kind of cultural reverence. relevance in the United States. So, you know, from that standpoint, now that you're in it, you are going to be there, whether you call it or not, you know, what would you like specifically to try to pull out of it, if anything, or are you just not concerned that much?",
