    "turn_text": "Is there any, is there any desire for you to understand the PJ tour and Jay Monahan and specifics sort of 180 degree term from invoking the attacks on 9-11 and a moral high ground and saying that the PGA toward players will never have to apologize for where they play golf two a year later sitting next to the same folks that he said folks players would have to apologize for and cutting a deal.",
